                   RowBox[{"AppendTo", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"history", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"center", ",", "width"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ";", 
                   "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                   RowBox[{"width", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"width", "/", "zoomFactor"}]}]}], ",", 
                  RowBox[{"Method", "->", "\"\<Queued\>\""}]}], "]"}]}], 
               "}"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"\"\<Resolution\>\"", ",", 
